WEBVTT

00:02:58.751 --> 00:03:01.218
dokler ni nastal lok.

00:03:01.218 --> 00:03:05.713
Nekega dne sem spreminjal 
obliko kosa bambusa

00:03:05.713 --> 00:03:10.468
in zanetil požar.

00:03:10.468 --> 00:03:15.257
Kje? Na strehi mojega bloka,

00:03:15.257 --> 00:03:18.897
kjer živi 96 družin.

00:03:18.897 --> 00:03:21.488
Stranka iz bližnje veleblagovnice 
nasproti mojega bloka

00:03:21.488 --> 00:03:22.978
je poklicala reševalce

00:03:22.978 --> 00:03:25.025
in jaz sem stekel dol in povedal mami,

00:03:25.025 --> 00:03:30.242
s pol glave zažganih las.